        customData = {
            string userDocBrief = """Half-extent of the bounded rectangle along the first\r
        IN-PLANE axis, U = (planeAxis + 1) % 3.\r
\r
        Separate from the falloff band on purpose, and the separation is\r
        the whole point: falloffMin/falloffMax are distances ALONG the\r
        axis and say where the gradient starts and stops, while the\r
